issue.\n\n## Expected vs. Observed\n| Expected Behavior | Observed Risk 
|\n|---|---|\n| When checking if a file should be read, the system should 
consider the MOST RECENT entry for that file to make accurate decisions about 
what lines have already been read. | The code finds the first matching entry 
